WEBVTT

01:40.570 --> 01:44.210
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.130 --> 01:47.080
[Episode 17]

01:48.280 --> 01:49.509
He's the type who knows how to repay kindness.

01:49.590 --> 01:50.430
You saved his life.

01:50.430 --> 01:51.789
He definitely won't forget you.

02:19.680 --> 02:20.910
Come on, speak.

02:21.120 --> 02:22.400
What are your names?

02:22.470 --> 02:23.280
Where are you from?

02:23.560 --> 02:24.400
What do you do for a living?

02:26.710 --> 02:28.120
We come from Pingzhou.

02:28.870 --> 02:29.840
My name is Yuan Zhong.

02:30.079 --> 02:30.960
The "yuan" means "treasure."

02:31.430 --> 02:32.310
My name is Kai Shan.

02:32.329 --> 02:33.230
Zi Fei.

02:33.750 --> 02:35.030
We have some modest wealth at home.

02:35.400 --> 02:36.310
We do some business.

02:36.910 --> 02:38.150
So, you lot

02:38.560 --> 02:39.840
came here to do business?

02:43.300 --> 02:44.460
Why are you looking at me?

02:44.960 --> 02:45.910
Answer me!

02:47.120 --> 02:48.310
Besides coming here for business,

02:49.120 --> 02:50.400
we're also looking for an old friend.

02:51.800 --> 02:52.590
Old friend?

02:53.030 --> 02:54.000
What's this old friend's name?

02:54.400 --> 02:55.280
Have you found them?

02:56.079 --> 02:56.870
Lu Chen.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.910
You know Lu Chen?

03:06.840 --> 03:07.680
I don't know him.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.310
Then why did you gasp?

03:09.630 --> 03:10.470
I gasped?

03:12.520 --> 03:13.690
Which "Lu" is it?

03:14.750 --> 03:16.030
"Lu" meaning "deer."

03:16.560 --> 03:17.680
I haven't heard of that one.

03:18.750 --> 03:19.870
In this town,

03:19.920 --> 03:21.550
there's no family with the surname Lu.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.750
You don't know Lu Chen,

03:26.280 --> 03:28.030
but surely you recognize us?

03:34.120 --> 03:35.190
Do you recall anything?

03:41.030 --> 03:42.120
Let me tell you something.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.590
Trying to get familiar won't work.

03:44.870 --> 03:46.000
Coming to this town,

03:46.000 --> 03:47.400
you must abide by the law

03:47.400 --> 03:48.360
and follow the rules.

03:48.680 --> 03:49.400
Recently,

03:49.400 --> 03:50.870
several children have gone missing.

03:51.030 --> 03:51.840
If I find out

03:51.840 --> 03:53.400
that you guys are involved,

03:53.800 --> 03:54.910
I won't go easy on you.

03:57.960 --> 03:58.930
Did you hear me?

04:02.500 --> 04:03.620
That's more like it.

04:04.610 --> 04:06.360
Alright, let's leave it at that for now.

04:11.310 --> 04:12.120
San.

04:12.800 --> 04:13.480
Jiu.

04:15.670 --> 04:16.470
Where's Yunniang?

04:16.720 --> 04:17.510
She's in the backyard.

04:20.510 --> 04:22.240
If I went to see her now,

04:22.240 --> 04:23.600
would it be inconvenient?

04:25.160 --> 04:25.950
Jiu,

04:25.970 --> 04:27.970
there's a stove in the kitchen

04:28.000 --> 04:28.880
that's not working well.

04:28.900 --> 04:30.630
Would you mind

04:30.660 --> 04:31.660
helping to fix it?

04:31.800 --> 04:32.750
You should have told me earlier!

04:32.750 --> 04:34.190
I'm good at fixing stoves.

04:34.210 --> 04:35.450
Let's go, let's go.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.159
Go investigate

04:41.159 --> 04:42.040
Pei Jiu's background.

04:42.190 --> 04:43.240
Then we'll make our plans.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.480
Alright.

04:50.240 --> 04:51.870
Don't worry about the money.

04:51.920 --> 04:52.630
Yuanzhong

04:52.630 --> 04:54.120
won't stand by and do nothing.

04:54.190 --> 04:55.240
With your word,

04:55.240 --> 04:56.190
I can rest assured.

04:56.190 --> 04:56.920
Yunniang!

04:59.780 --> 05:00.950
What are you doing here?

05:02.310 --> 05:04.040
San said the kitchen stove is broken.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.040
I'm here to fix it.

05:05.920 --> 05:06.720
San.

05:07.390 --> 05:08.750
Landlady, Jiu.

05:13.800 --> 05:15.070
I didn't know you had this skill.

05:15.570 --> 05:17.420
It's just fixing a stove. How hard can it be?

05:17.630 --> 05:18.390
Then go fix it.

05:18.390 --> 05:19.680
Why are you looking for me?

05:29.000 --> 05:29.800
Take a look.

05:30.400 --> 05:31.190
Do you like it?

05:32.870 --> 05:33.750
It's alright, I guess.

05:35.270 --> 05:36.190
When will you marry me?

05:37.290 --> 05:38.850
I've been preparing all this time.

05:39.080 --> 05:40.110
Have you changed your mind

05:40.140 --> 05:41.140
and don't want to marry me anymore?

05:41.360 --> 05:42.310
Of course not.

05:42.720 --> 05:44.310
I've been working hard to save money.

05:44.480 --> 05:45.270
I plan to

05:45.430 --> 05:47.680
renovate the house beautifully,

05:47.870 --> 05:49.430
and then bring you home as my bride.

05:50.440 --> 05:51.590
With your meager constable's salary,

05:51.610 --> 05:52.780
how long will I have to wait?

05:58.060 --> 06:00.260
Soon, very soon.

06:01.720 --> 06:02.800
This is Miss Ji,

06:02.800 --> 06:03.680
a guest at my inn.

06:03.680 --> 06:04.630
She's very kind-hearted.

06:07.980 --> 06:09.220
Are they the outsiders?

06:09.650 --> 06:10.410
Of course.

06:10.510 --> 06:11.120
If they weren't outsiders,

06:11.120 --> 06:12.160
why would they be staying at my place?

06:13.240 --> 06:14.630
The town hasn't been peaceful lately.

06:14.830 --> 06:15.510
Near the old temple,

06:15.510 --> 06:17.120
several young beggars have gone missing.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.510
I hope it's not their doing.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.680
Look at how they're dressed,

06:21.680 --> 06:22.680
so elegant and refined.

06:22.720 --> 06:24.040
What would they want with little beggars?

06:24.040 --> 06:24.680
Those kids

06:24.680 --> 06:25.360
fish in the east village one day

06:25.360 --> 06:26.390
and beg in the west village the next.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.950
Who knows if they haven't just run off on their own?

06:28.070 --> 06:29.750
We should still be cautious.

06:30.270 --> 06:31.160
Alright, alright, alright.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.510
Miss Ji,

06:32.630 --> 06:33.720
I'll take you to the pharmacy.

06:37.600 --> 06:39.560
I need to find a chance to investigate them.

06:49.390 --> 06:50.360
What's all this?

06:54.120 --> 06:55.270
This is from the butcher shop.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.360
This is from the pharmacy.

06:57.950 --> 06:58.680
This one is from the inn.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.510
What I'm asking is

07:00.720 --> 07:02.000
why do you have so many IOUs?

07:03.600 --> 07:04.430
In the inn,

07:04.750 --> 07:06.270
there's a young man who was severely injured

07:06.270 --> 07:07.560
and is unconscious.

07:07.560 --> 07:08.680
He has no money.

07:09.190 --> 07:10.600
The landlady initially

07:10.920 --> 07:12.310
took him in due to kindness,

07:12.310 --> 07:12.830
but now,

07:12.830 --> 07:14.310
she has run out of money too.

07:14.680 --> 07:16.070
So, she had no choice

07:16.070 --> 07:17.600
but to turn him out.

07:18.390 --> 07:19.070
I thought

07:19.070 --> 07:20.560
he was really pitiful.

07:20.750 --> 07:22.070
So I wanted to help him.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.630
The landlady is kind-hearted,

07:25.870 --> 07:26.800
and so are you.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.680
I can understand all of this.

07:29.480 --> 07:31.070
But why do I have to pay?

07:31.270 --> 07:32.680
If you pay, you'll be kind-hearted too.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.800
I don't want to be kind-hearted.

07:33.800 --> 07:34.510
Get out.

07:34.600 --> 07:35.390
Yuanzhong,

07:35.510 --> 07:36.720
saving a life is better than building a seven-story pagoda.

07:36.720 --> 07:37.430
Get out.

07:43.600 --> 07:44.390
Wait.

07:48.040 --> 07:49.159
Take these with you.

07:53.630 --> 07:54.430
What?

07:54.870 --> 07:56.000
I'm your handmaiden.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.480
Shouldn't you pay me wages?

08:01.240 --> 08:02.600
See if these are enough.

08:04.120 --> 08:04.920
Enough, enough, enough.

08:04.920 --> 08:06.310
Actually, we don't need this much.

08:07.390 --> 08:09.340
How about I keep the rest here?

08:09.430 --> 08:10.950
I promise to use the best medicine for him.

08:11.160 --> 08:12.680
Alright, saving him is the priority.

08:16.270 --> 08:17.430
Pei Jiu probably came to town

08:17.430 --> 08:18.480
about 10 years ago.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.070
He seemed to be severely injured.

08:20.750 --> 08:22.040
He collapsed on the road at that time.

08:22.040 --> 08:23.430
The old constable rescued him.

08:23.800 --> 08:25.510
When he woke up, he had amnesia.

08:25.630 --> 08:26.600
The old constable felt sorry for him

08:26.600 --> 08:27.630
and adopted him

08:27.720 --> 08:28.800
until three years ago,

08:28.830 --> 08:29.950
when old constable Pei passed away.

08:30.190 --> 08:31.680
He took over the old constable's position

08:31.700 --> 08:33.100
and became the constable of this town.

08:34.360 --> 08:35.750
Perhaps while he was under the seal,

08:35.789 --> 08:37.200
he sensed some threat.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.720
That's why he forcibly broke through the seal.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.960
The places where Kai Shan and others were sealed

08:41.960 --> 08:42.960
were very hidden.

08:43.510 --> 08:44.720
Who could have discovered him

08:44.720 --> 08:46.080
and posed a threat to him?

08:46.200 --> 08:47.510
It seems we need to wake him up

08:48.320 --> 08:49.670
to know the inside story.

08:51.030 --> 08:51.840
But...

08:54.480 --> 08:55.270
What's wrong?

08:57.750 --> 08:58.840
There's a rumor in town

08:59.550 --> 09:01.000
that Pei Jiu is going to marry

09:01.000 --> 09:02.150
the landlady of this inn.

09:05.150 --> 09:06.360
He's going to marry her?

09:07.270 --> 09:08.080
It's said that

09:08.750 --> 09:10.670
this landlady is a widow.

09:11.030 --> 09:11.960
This is Lu Chen.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.840
He's now Pei Jiu.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.240
Do you have any way

09:17.240 --> 09:18.360
to restore him?

09:18.440 --> 09:19.080
He must have

09:19.080 --> 09:20.200
injured the meridians in his head

09:20.570 --> 09:21.900
when he broke through the seal.

09:22.240 --> 09:23.720
If I use the power of the Divine Hand

09:24.120 --> 09:25.320
to help clear his meridians,

09:26.240 --> 09:27.910
perhaps I can restore him.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.080
It's good if he can be restored.

09:29.150 --> 09:30.910
Fortunately, we brought abundant money

09:30.910 --> 09:32.550
so we can stay here comfortably.

09:34.750 --> 09:35.550
Now,

09:36.240 --> 09:37.960
it may not be as abundant as before.

09:38.200 --> 09:39.000
Why?

09:39.910 --> 09:40.840
It seems that

09:41.000 --> 09:42.320
10 years ago, Lu Chen encountered

09:42.480 --> 09:44.360
an unexpected situation while sealed.

09:44.630 --> 09:45.630
He had no choice but to

09:45.720 --> 09:47.000
forcibly break through the seal,

09:47.270 --> 09:48.390
thus damaging his essence

09:48.510 --> 09:50.000
and forgetting his past.

09:50.360 --> 09:51.510
To restore him,

09:51.750 --> 09:53.360
I need to use the power of the Divine Hand

09:53.380 --> 09:54.940
to help guide the spiritual energy within him.

09:55.440 --> 09:57.000
But it also requires his cooperation.

09:57.120 --> 09:58.720
However, he doesn't recognize us now.

09:58.990 --> 10:00.230
It'll take some effort

10:00.390 --> 10:01.630
to make him listen to us.

10:01.910 --> 10:02.720
So,

10:02.870 --> 10:04.200
I need you to go and investigate.

10:04.640 --> 10:05.520
I understand.

10:10.630 --> 10:11.600
What is he doing?

10:11.960 --> 10:13.080
He's getting dressed.

10:13.390 --> 10:14.510
It seems he's about to go out.

10:14.630 --> 10:15.670
He's not dressed?

10:16.030 --> 10:17.000
He has pants on.

10:19.630 --> 10:20.440
Did she spy on you

10:20.440 --> 10:21.670
like this before?

10:22.070 --> 10:23.830
Were you wearing pants at that time?

10:23.960 --> 10:24.680
Shut up.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.510
He's running fast.

10:34.030 --> 10:35.200
It looks like he's going...

10:35.750 --> 10:36.550
Where is he going?

10:37.960 --> 10:39.150
He's downstairs.

10:40.440 --> 10:41.790
He's entered our courtyard.

11:08.910 --> 11:09.720
Miss Ji,

11:09.910 --> 11:11.150
your method is really good.

11:11.270 --> 11:12.440
After wiping with vinegar,

11:12.440 --> 11:13.750
this cup is much cleaner.

11:14.670 --> 11:16.360
No need to put in so much effort anymore

11:16.480 --> 11:17.960
to wash the tea stains at the bottom.

11:18.200 --> 11:19.720
That wasn't my idea.

11:19.720 --> 11:21.000
I've been reading a book recently

11:21.000 --> 11:22.030
called "The Book of Hundred Skills."

11:22.030 --> 11:23.600
It's all written in there.

11:25.960 --> 11:26.960
Come with me for a moment.

11:59.420 --> 12:00.160
Stop right there!

12:02.030 --> 12:03.120
Why are you running?

12:03.480 --> 12:04.360
Let me go!

12:04.630 --> 12:05.600
Where are Er and Qiuqiu?

12:05.600 --> 12:06.510
Have you seen them?

12:06.510 --> 12:07.720
I haven't seen them.

12:13.320 --> 12:14.550
Do you know where they went?

12:14.750 --> 12:16.000
We originally agreed

12:16.000 --> 12:17.790
to go to the market in Siping Village together...

12:18.630 --> 12:19.840
To steal from there.

12:20.510 --> 12:21.240
But I've been waiting here

12:21.240 --> 12:22.720
for two days.

12:23.030 --> 12:24.600
They haven't been back for two days.

12:25.270 --> 12:26.060
Oh no.

12:26.410 --> 12:27.480
I'm afraid something's happened.

12:35.630 --> 12:37.030
What are you doing here?

12:37.480 --> 12:38.480
I have something to discuss with you.

12:40.000 --> 12:40.790
Is that so?

12:42.000 --> 12:42.790
Just arrived?

12:43.030 --> 12:43.840
What else?

12:44.240 --> 12:45.670
We really came here to find you.

12:48.720 --> 12:50.240
The town has had unrest lately.

12:50.480 --> 12:51.670
You outsiders

12:51.670 --> 12:52.960
better not wander around.

12:53.440 --> 12:55.080
It wouldn't look good if there were any misunderstandings.

12:57.080 --> 12:57.870
Oh, right.

12:58.440 --> 12:59.790
You said you were looking for me earlier.

12:59.910 --> 13:00.720
What's the matter?

13:00.960 --> 13:02.240
I see you have good potential.

13:02.870 --> 13:03.870
I want to take you as my disciple

13:04.360 --> 13:05.270
to teach you martial arts.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.320
What kind of new scam is this?

13:09.080 --> 13:10.600
With your scrawny build,

13:10.600 --> 13:11.600
taking me as your disciple?

13:17.480 --> 13:18.600
I got it.

13:18.630 --> 13:19.440
Are you planning

13:19.440 --> 13:20.230
to have me beat you up

13:20.250 --> 13:21.560
and then report me to the authorities

13:21.590 --> 13:22.440
to extort money from me?

13:25.130 --> 13:25.920
Constable Pei.

13:26.030 --> 13:26.840
I'm very busy.

13:26.860 --> 13:27.980
I don't have time to deal with you.

13:30.670 --> 13:31.640
You've got some skills.

13:35.790 --> 13:37.190
You're getting serious with me?

13:48.300 --> 13:49.180
Your physique is good.

13:49.390 --> 13:50.480
Your strength is decent too.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.400
But unfortunately, your speed is lacking.

13:56.790 --> 13:57.720
Your breathing is unstable.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.240
Your burst power is also insufficient.

14:18.840 --> 14:20.480
You've suffered a severe injury before,

14:21.000 --> 14:22.480
causing blockage in your meridians,

14:22.680 --> 14:24.110
preventing smooth circulation of qi.

14:24.140 --> 14:25.610
Even with my injury, I can still beat you.

14:28.080 --> 14:29.480
Are you sure you can beat me?

14:30.150 --> 14:30.960
Absolutely.

14:34.080 --> 14:34.870
What do you think?

14:35.080 --> 14:36.390
Do you want to become my disciple?

14:37.140 --> 14:38.350
I'd rather bow to your grandmother.

14:39.800 --> 14:41.030
Alright, stop fighting.

14:41.030 --> 14:42.270
You can't beat him.

14:46.670 --> 14:47.480
Be careful!

14:50.240 --> 14:51.080
Give up.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.630
You're no match for him.

14:52.630 --> 14:53.550
Just become his disciple.

14:54.870 --> 14:56.440
I see you have great potential.

14:56.790 --> 14:58.320
That's why I'm kindly giving you guidance.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.630
I can heal your injury,

15:00.790 --> 15:02.480
unblock your clogged meridians,

15:02.630 --> 15:04.550
and make your qi circulation even better than now.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.240
So, what do you say?

15:07.750 --> 15:08.750
Do you want to become my disciple?

15:15.670 --> 15:16.550
Why did he leave?

15:17.440 --> 15:18.630
He seems to be angry.

15:22.360 --> 15:23.320
Mr. Yuan, Miss Ji,

15:23.320 --> 15:24.670
you went out in such strong sunlight?

15:25.750 --> 15:26.440
Madam,

15:26.440 --> 15:27.200
could you please bring some water

15:27.200 --> 15:28.150
to our room upstairs later?

15:28.150 --> 15:30.030
The sun is really scorching.

15:30.050 --> 15:30.840
Thank you.

15:30.910 --> 15:31.670
Miss Ji, wait a moment.

15:31.670 --> 15:32.270
Don't go.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.630
You can drink water downstairs.

15:33.670 --> 15:34.550
I'm about to offer incense.

15:34.570 --> 15:35.220
Since you're here,

15:35.250 --> 15:36.170
why don't you join me?

15:36.550 --> 15:37.910
I won't pray.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.240
T-This isn't convenient for me.

15:41.670 --> 15:43.120
What's inconvenient about it?

15:43.120 --> 15:44.270
You believe in a different god?

15:44.660 --> 15:46.180
Well, it's not really because of that.

15:46.600 --> 15:47.960
Then what's the problem?

15:47.960 --> 15:49.120
When you enter a temple, you must burn incense.

15:49.120 --> 15:50.200
When you encounter a god, you must pray.

15:50.240 --> 15:51.630
This is how you ensure everything goes smoothly.

15:52.030 --> 15:53.360
But the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

15:53.360 --> 15:54.720
isn't a god, right?

15:54.720 --> 15:55.910
How is she not a god?

15:56.120 --> 15:57.360
Wherever the Mute Goddess passes,

15:57.360 --> 15:58.240
deserts turn into oases,

15:58.240 --> 15:59.320
and sandy lands become fertile fields.

15:59.320 --> 16:00.360
With a mere touch from her,

16:00.360 --> 16:01.440
even the most mischievous and clumsy children

16:01.440 --> 16:02.240
can read and write,

16:02.240 --> 16:03.080
becoming clever and quick-witted.

16:03.200 --> 16:04.200
If this doesn't count as divine, what does?

16:04.750 --> 16:06.320
Is there a possibility that

16:06.360 --> 16:07.080
after the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

16:07.080 --> 16:08.240
arrived here,

16:08.320 --> 16:09.510
she discovered it was arid,

16:09.510 --> 16:10.870
so she taught people to dig wells?

16:10.870 --> 16:11.910
She saw the barrenness here,

16:11.910 --> 16:13.150
so she taught people to farm?

16:13.320 --> 16:14.030
When she saw children

16:14.030 --> 16:15.320
with no schools to learn in,

16:15.340 --> 16:16.580
she taught them to read?

16:16.670 --> 16:18.080
There was no miraculous transformation

16:18.080 --> 16:19.670
of barren land into oases or enlightenment by touch.

16:20.750 --> 16:22.600
There is indeed such a legend.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.030
I once heard from the elders

16:24.030 --> 16:25.750
that the Mute Goddess was just an ordinary person.

16:25.770 --> 16:27.440
She was kind-hearted and knowledgeable,

16:27.440 --> 16:28.840
willing to teach children to read and write,

16:28.840 --> 16:30.360
and led everyone in farming,

16:30.600 --> 16:32.270
so that the hungry could have food to eat.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.150
Yes,

16:33.150 --> 16:34.790
she was just an ordinary person after all.

16:35.630 --> 16:37.270
How can she be considered ordinary?

16:37.840 --> 16:38.790
Does one have to fight and kill

16:38.790 --> 16:40.070
or have superpowers to be called a god?

16:40.480 --> 16:41.910
The Mute Goddess spread knowledge and education,

16:41.910 --> 16:42.550
saving countless lives,

16:42.550 --> 16:43.750
accumulating such great merit.

16:43.750 --> 16:44.910
How can she not be considered divine?

16:45.000 --> 16:45.670
People like her,

16:45.670 --> 16:46.960
even if they weren't gods before,

16:47.030 --> 16:48.000
would surely ascend after death,

16:48.000 --> 16:48.960
becoming an immortal.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.600
We people of the Eastern Wilderness

16:51.600 --> 16:52.600
don't care about those details.

16:52.630 --> 16:53.440
Rather than believing in those

16:53.440 --> 16:54.670
who can shatter a mountain with one palm,

16:54.840 --> 16:56.600
or the murderous gods who can destroy a city with one punch,

16:56.620 --> 16:58.410
we only believe in the gods who are good to us.

16:59.360 --> 17:01.000
The Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain saves all living beings

17:01.030 --> 17:02.030
with great compassion and mercy.

17:02.550 --> 17:03.960
She has always been blessing us.

17:04.109 --> 17:05.750
I, Yunniang, offer incense to the Goddess,

17:05.750 --> 17:06.880
asking for her protection.

17:06.880 --> 17:08.510
May wealth flow in abundance and livestock be safe and sound.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.720
Mainly for the wealth to flow in abundance.

17:29.310 --> 17:29.830
Yuan…

17:47.400 --> 17:48.400
You lost the fight.

17:48.440 --> 17:49.510
Not satisfied, are you?

17:50.830 --> 17:53.240
if you're not satisfied, we can fight some more.

17:54.640 --> 17:56.590
You're the best, okay?

17:58.210 --> 17:59.560
You just want to be praised, don't you?

17:59.590 --> 18:01.030
Is it enough if I praise you a hundred times?

18:03.590 --> 18:04.400
Lu Chen.

18:05.070 --> 18:06.200
Think about it.

18:06.590 --> 18:07.510
Do you really want to stay in a tiny place

18:07.510 --> 18:08.200
like Eastern Wilderness

18:08.200 --> 18:09.160
for your entire life?

18:09.490 --> 18:10.590
Pei Jiu, Pei Jiu.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.720
Who's Lu Chen?

18:12.070 --> 18:13.000
Are you slow in the head

18:13.000 --> 18:13.880
and have a bad memory too?

18:14.160 --> 18:15.200
That's not important.

18:15.510 --> 18:16.830
I'm talking about your life.

18:17.510 --> 18:19.000
Don't you want to go out

18:19.000 --> 18:19.880
and see the world

18:19.880 --> 18:20.960
and martial world?

18:20.960 --> 18:22.000
Haven't you ever thought

18:22.000 --> 18:22.920
that with your talent

18:22.920 --> 18:23.880
and abilities,

18:23.880 --> 18:25.480
you could easily become a swordsman

18:25.480 --> 18:26.920
and do much greater things?

18:26.920 --> 18:28.350
Go to a broader world?

18:30.110 --> 18:31.960
When I get to that broader world,

18:32.290 --> 18:33.380
what should I do?

18:37.030 --> 18:37.880
Ride across the martial world.

18:38.590 --> 18:39.510
Traverse the mountains.

18:39.960 --> 18:40.790
Become a marquis or a minister.

18:42.750 --> 18:43.590
Make a name for yourself.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.240
If everyone becomes a marquis or a minister,

18:50.010 --> 18:51.140
who will be the common people?

18:52.960 --> 18:53.920
Who will farm the land?

18:54.830 --> 18:56.830
You swordsmen in the martial world,

18:57.590 --> 18:58.510
don't you need to eat?

18:59.440 --> 19:00.240
And look,

19:00.510 --> 19:02.070
Sir, your outfit

19:02.240 --> 19:03.720
is so sleek and shiny.

19:04.200 --> 19:05.590
When you're riding across the martial world,

19:05.590 --> 19:06.550
do you wear clothes

19:06.880 --> 19:07.680
or are you naked?

19:07.730 --> 19:08.530
You—

19:08.750 --> 19:10.880
Moreover, can you survive in the martial world

19:11.510 --> 19:12.830
for a lifetime?

19:13.350 --> 19:14.310
Is being a swordsman

19:14.830 --> 19:16.460
such an impressive thing?

19:20.480 --> 19:22.400
Do you martial world wanderers have official ranks?

19:22.680 --> 19:24.920
Are you registered with the government?

19:25.070 --> 19:26.680
Do you get allowances for holidays?

19:27.210 --> 19:28.370
If you're injured or sick,

19:28.510 --> 19:29.960
does the government provide medical care?

19:30.580 --> 19:32.930
Do you get a monthly salary?

19:33.400 --> 19:34.200
And also,

19:34.640 --> 19:35.720
when you get old

19:35.720 --> 19:36.510
and can't fight anymore,

19:36.590 --> 19:37.880
how will you make a living?

19:40.890 --> 19:41.580
You...

19:44.930 --> 19:46.450
You'll have nothing.

19:46.880 --> 19:49.000
That's not traversing the mountains.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.870
That's called being homeless.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.880
You've seen those little beggars

19:57.880 --> 19:58.750
at the village entrance, right?

19:59.350 --> 20:01.400
A bunch of tiny beggars,

20:01.550 --> 20:03.400
hopping from one village to another.

20:03.600 --> 20:04.400
When they grow up a bit,

20:04.480 --> 20:06.240
they'll become

20:06.240 --> 20:07.310
thieving troublemakers.

20:07.310 --> 20:08.110
When they grow up more,

20:08.200 --> 20:09.640
they'll become swordsmen like you.

20:09.660 --> 20:10.490
To be honest,

20:11.270 --> 20:12.960
among the cases we constables handle,

20:13.090 --> 20:14.350
eight out of 10

20:14.350 --> 20:15.920
are committed by people like you.

20:16.780 --> 20:17.930
If I wanted to be a vagrant,

20:18.350 --> 20:19.440
why would I go through all this trouble

20:19.440 --> 20:20.630
to become a constable?

20:21.000 --> 20:22.590
Why would I need to take you as my master?

20:23.160 --> 20:24.750
As long as I choose the right path from the start,

20:24.750 --> 20:25.590
I'll reach the peak right from the beginning.

20:25.590 --> 20:26.880
I can be homeless from the beginning.

20:27.270 --> 20:27.890
I mean,

20:29.000 --> 20:29.790
be a swordsman.

20:30.880 --> 20:31.430
I...

20:41.590 --> 20:42.400
How is it?

20:43.350 --> 20:44.590
It's a beautiful wedding dress.

20:45.590 --> 20:46.440
You don't know,

20:46.880 --> 20:47.680
but this was my wedding dress

20:47.680 --> 20:48.920
from my last marriage.

20:49.070 --> 20:49.830
Unfortunately, that poor soul

20:49.830 --> 20:50.880
was short-lived.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.590
He didn't have the fortune

20:51.590 --> 20:52.960
to see me in such beautiful clothes.

21:00.160 --> 21:02.000
It's alright, I'm not sad about it.

21:02.000 --> 21:03.480
Out with the old, in with the new, right?

21:03.830 --> 21:05.590
Besides, I'm getting married again.

21:05.590 --> 21:07.590
Relationships come and go. It's all fate.

21:07.920 --> 21:09.070
As for Pei Jiu,

21:09.790 --> 21:10.790
he has many flaws,

21:10.960 --> 21:12.070
but his good qualities

21:12.240 --> 21:13.270
are truly good.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.440
Are you going to marry Constable Pei?

21:19.510 --> 21:20.790
You really like him, don't you?

21:23.790 --> 21:24.750
He's alright.

21:25.480 --> 21:27.270
He's sloppy and careless,

21:27.270 --> 21:28.480
with no money or a background.

21:28.480 --> 21:29.720
He doesn't even have any relatives.

21:30.200 --> 21:31.510
If something were to happen,

21:31.550 --> 21:32.680
there'd be no one to lend a hand.

21:33.110 --> 21:34.200
But I think he's

21:34.350 --> 21:35.830
reliable and steady.

21:36.240 --> 21:37.310
I find him pleasing to look at,

21:37.310 --> 21:37.960
so I don't care

21:37.960 --> 21:38.880
about the other things.

21:39.160 --> 21:41.180
I'm just waiting for him to earn some money now,

21:41.200 --> 21:42.890
so he can fix up the house,

21:42.920 --> 21:44.110
gather the betrothal gifts,

21:44.110 --> 21:45.110
and prepare the money

21:45.200 --> 21:45.830
for the wedding.

21:46.270 --> 21:47.030
Then I'll go live with him.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.130
I see your inn

21:49.160 --> 21:49.750
has good business.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.110
You have income every day.

21:51.590 --> 21:52.750
You shouldn't be short of money.

21:53.350 --> 21:55.070
Why do you have to wait for him to earn money

21:55.070 --> 21:56.160
before you can get married?

21:56.830 --> 21:57.590
If I don't wait for him to earn money,

21:57.590 --> 21:59.110
should I subsidize him instead?

22:00.110 --> 22:01.720
I-Is that not okay?

22:02.400 --> 22:03.830
Of course not!

22:04.240 --> 22:05.400
Being poor is one thing.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.590
Having no ambition is another.

22:06.790 --> 22:07.750
In these peaceful times,

22:07.750 --> 22:09.240
is it really that hard to earn some money?

22:09.240 --> 22:10.070
If he can't make big money,

22:10.070 --> 22:11.240
can't he at least make some small money?

22:11.240 --> 22:12.830
Making him do this is to let him experience

22:12.830 --> 22:14.030
the feeling of wanting to

22:14.030 --> 22:14.920
bring a wife home.

22:15.200 --> 22:15.960
Moreover,

22:15.960 --> 22:17.270
I want him to remember for the rest of his life

22:17.270 --> 22:18.480
the hard work he put in

22:18.480 --> 22:20.160
and the effort he made.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.480
Only then will he cherish

22:21.480 --> 22:22.550
the woman he marries.

22:23.790 --> 22:24.510
If I were to have

22:24.510 --> 22:25.830
the mindset of not caring whether he has money or not,

22:25.920 --> 22:26.720
willing to walk barefoot

22:26.720 --> 22:28.030
into his home,

22:28.030 --> 22:28.790
then let me tell you,

22:28.790 --> 22:29.310
my life

22:29.310 --> 22:30.350
would definitely not be good.

22:30.350 --> 22:31.270
Because from the moment he agrees

22:31.270 --> 22:32.750
to let me enter his home in such a sorry state,

22:32.750 --> 22:34.100
it's destined that he won't care about me.

22:34.320 --> 22:35.510
At this very moment, right now,

22:35.510 --> 22:36.240
he already doesn't care about me.

22:36.240 --> 22:37.000
Do you understand?

22:39.030 --> 22:41.160
I think I understand a little.

22:42.360 --> 22:43.360
You still don't understand.

22:43.590 --> 22:44.720
You haven't been married yet.

22:45.000 --> 22:46.480
When you meet the person you want to marry,

22:46.480 --> 22:47.070
when you meet someone

22:47.070 --> 22:48.350
you fall for at first sight,

22:48.880 --> 22:50.400
then you'll understand what I'm talking about.

22:50.830 --> 22:51.630
Is that so?

23:00.050 --> 23:00.900
What are you thinking about?

23:01.500 --> 23:02.670
Thinking about your young master, aren't you?

23:02.920 --> 23:04.160
You two are a couple, right?

23:04.440 --> 23:05.240
No.

23:06.030 --> 23:06.750
Impossible.

23:06.750 --> 23:07.830
The way you look at him isn't normal.

23:07.830 --> 23:09.240
The way he looks at you isn't normal either.

23:10.030 --> 23:11.030
We really aren't.

23:11.550 --> 23:13.160
Things between us are complicated.

23:14.120 --> 23:15.360
You wouldn't understand.

23:16.230 --> 23:17.680
What's so complicated about it?

23:17.680 --> 23:19.310
Isn't it just that thing between a man and woman?

23:20.310 --> 23:21.110
Let me ask you,

23:21.920 --> 23:23.590
if Mr. Yuan got hurt,

23:23.830 --> 23:24.590
would you be worried

23:24.590 --> 23:25.550
and anxious?

23:25.880 --> 23:27.350
Of course I would be worried.

23:27.350 --> 23:28.590
Then if you get sick,

23:28.590 --> 23:30.000
do you think he would be upset?

23:34.570 --> 23:35.810
That's hard to say.

23:36.200 --> 23:37.310
How can that be hard to say?

23:37.310 --> 23:38.790
Of course he would be upset.

23:39.040 --> 23:40.720
The fact is, you like him,

23:40.750 --> 23:41.550
and he likes you too.

23:41.550 --> 23:42.270
That's right.

23:42.550 --> 23:43.790
Does he like me?

23:44.000 --> 23:45.070
Isn't that obvious?

23:45.070 --> 23:46.110
If he didn't like you,

23:46.110 --> 23:47.000
why would he keep you by his side

23:47.000 --> 23:47.650
all the time?

23:47.710 --> 23:48.640
To annoy himself?

23:51.790 --> 23:52.590
But he...

23:53.070 --> 23:54.550
But even if he didn't bring me along,

23:54.790 --> 23:56.400
I would naturally follow him anyway.

23:57.070 --> 23:58.310
Well, there you have it.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.030
You see,

23:59.160 --> 24:00.510
you two are both in love.

24:00.510 --> 24:01.920
You two should be together.

24:05.600 --> 24:07.120
None of my ideas work!

24:07.140 --> 24:07.980
What else can we do?

24:09.770 --> 24:10.590
I'm starving.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.680
We can't reason with him.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.720
His temper is awful and stubborn.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.750
And he's so pigheaded.

24:13.750 --> 24:15.070
I can't beat him up for real.

24:15.270 --> 24:16.400
He won't fall for any tricks either.

24:17.470 --> 24:19.640
What's his weakness?

24:19.750 --> 24:21.270
It might be because he has no money.

24:22.110 --> 24:23.590
I heard something today.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.750
Pei Jiu wants to

24:24.750 --> 24:26.240
marry the landlady here,

24:26.440 --> 24:28.000
but he doesn't have money to build a house,

24:28.000 --> 24:29.310
buy the betrothal gifts,

24:29.310 --> 24:30.160
or to hold the wedding.

24:30.400 --> 24:31.070
So now

24:31.070 --> 24:31.960
he's probably thinking about

24:31.960 --> 24:32.550
how he can

24:32.550 --> 24:33.720
get money from anywhere.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.310
The thing is, you like him,

25:04.310 --> 25:05.110
and he likes you too.

25:05.110 --> 25:05.830
That's right.

25:13.110 --> 25:15.160
Just looking at him makes me happy?

25:22.000 --> 25:23.070
What are you standing there for?

25:23.070 --> 25:23.830
Come and help.

25:27.510 --> 25:28.590
I don't think so.

25:28.920 --> 25:29.720
What do you mean?

25:31.160 --> 25:32.720
Yunniang was wrong.

25:33.510 --> 25:34.310
What was wrong?

25:35.310 --> 25:37.510
I don't feel happy at all.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.030
What are you

25:40.030 --> 25:40.830
mumbling about?

25:41.680 --> 25:43.510
I'm just not happy right now.

25:47.550 --> 25:48.880
Are you guys done yet?

25:48.880 --> 25:50.440
You're just meeting Lu Chen.

25:59.160 --> 25:59.880
Master.

25:59.880 --> 26:00.590
Master.

26:01.590 --> 26:02.790
Please accept your disciple's bow.

26:06.720 --> 26:07.310
Master.

26:07.330 --> 26:09.050
I've heard about your glorious deed of accepting disciples

26:09.080 --> 26:09.950
for a hefty sum.

26:10.030 --> 26:10.960
I understand all the rules.

26:10.980 --> 26:12.180
I wish to become your disciple.

26:12.270 --> 26:14.110
I'll devote myself to cultivation and serve you, Master.

26:14.140 --> 26:16.140
Master, please accept me as your disciple.

26:16.510 --> 26:17.210
I don't take disciples.

26:17.240 --> 26:18.000
Master.

26:18.110 --> 26:19.830
My aptitude is definitely better than Jiu's.

26:19.830 --> 26:21.270
I'll learn whatever you teach.

26:21.270 --> 26:22.240
I'll master everything.

26:22.240 --> 26:23.590
Master, most importantly,

26:23.590 --> 26:24.830
I'm not as greedy as Jiu.

26:24.830 --> 26:26.160
I won't take so much money from you.

26:26.350 --> 26:28.110
Master, just give whatever you think is appropriate.

26:28.110 --> 26:29.070
Any amount will do.

26:29.320 --> 26:30.990
Master, they're all after

26:31.010 --> 26:32.050
the money in your pocket.

26:32.080 --> 26:33.040
I'm different.

26:33.070 --> 26:34.030
Money doesn't matter

26:34.030 --> 26:35.000
to me.

26:35.000 --> 26:36.350
I simply want to learn from

26:36.350 --> 26:37.880
a generous master like you.

26:37.970 --> 26:39.420
Master, please accept me.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.640
As for the price,

26:40.640 --> 26:41.640
we can negotiate it.

26:41.880 --> 26:43.430
Master, give us a straight answer.

26:43.450 --> 26:44.860
What exactly do you like about Jiu?

26:44.890 --> 26:45.560
I can change.

26:45.590 --> 26:46.990
Other than looks, I'm sure

26:47.010 --> 26:48.730
I can change to be just like him.

26:50.290 --> 26:51.090
-Master!
-Master!

26:57.450 --> 26:58.110
I don't take disciples.

26:58.150 --> 26:59.840
Master! Master! Master!

27:00.100 --> 27:00.900
Master!

27:01.440 --> 27:02.590
Master, please take me as your disciple!

27:02.590 --> 27:03.310
San!

27:03.590 --> 27:04.400
Si!

27:04.550 --> 27:05.350
Where are they?

27:05.370 --> 27:06.320
They just ran out.

27:07.550 --> 27:08.200
Miss Ji,

27:08.200 --> 27:09.350
come, I need a small favor.

27:09.350 --> 27:10.240
Let's go, let's go.

27:14.240 --> 27:15.030
Miss Ji,

27:15.200 --> 27:16.230
I have an appointment with the butcher shop owner

27:16.230 --> 27:17.030
to settle the bill.

27:17.110 --> 27:18.270
Si and the others are not here.

27:18.400 --> 27:19.350
It's almost mealtime,

27:19.350 --> 27:20.830
but we can't let the poor man go hungry, right?

27:21.070 --> 27:22.070
So I can only ask you

27:22.580 --> 27:24.010
to help with this.

27:24.110 --> 27:25.480
I can help,

27:25.590 --> 27:27.070
but he's still unconscious.

27:27.160 --> 27:28.480
Feeding him won't work.

27:29.030 --> 27:30.260
This shows your lack of experience.

27:30.570 --> 27:31.890
Pry open his mouth and feed him.

27:31.960 --> 27:32.830
It doesn't matter how much he eats.

27:32.830 --> 27:34.000
It's better than not eating at all, right?

27:34.340 --> 27:35.930
Alright then, I'll be going now.

27:59.070 --> 27:59.880
Miss,

28:00.390 --> 28:01.830
could you tell me how to get to the first-class cabins?

28:04.140 --> 28:05.010
What did you say?

28:06.800 --> 28:08.110
I... I was asking

28:08.680 --> 28:10.330
how to get to the first-class cabins.

28:11.310 --> 28:12.480
I remember now.

28:13.400 --> 28:14.400
I've seen you before.

28:15.510 --> 28:16.440
You got injured on the tower ship,

28:16.440 --> 28:17.400
didn't you?

28:20.680 --> 28:22.110
What a coincidence we meet again.

28:23.110 --> 28:24.350
Come on, open your mouth.

28:32.880 --> 28:34.270
You must eat more

28:34.720 --> 28:36.310
so you can recover quickly.

29:06.920 --> 29:08.350
Come on, hurry up.

29:08.440 --> 29:09.350
Don't waste time.

29:09.350 --> 29:10.750
I only have two hours to spare.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.440
I'll leave when time's up.

29:12.790 --> 29:14.240
I still need to go to the magistrate's office later.

29:14.240 --> 29:15.640
I have a pile of things to do.

29:16.350 --> 29:17.790
I've paid you the silver.

29:19.400 --> 29:20.880
Listen to yourself.

29:21.170 --> 29:22.170
If you hadn't paid me,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.240
I wouldn't have come.

29:23.420 --> 29:24.040
Come on.

29:24.440 --> 29:25.720
Weren't you going to teach me martial arts?

29:26.550 --> 29:27.720
Where do we start?

29:28.430 --> 29:29.230
How about this?

29:29.430 --> 29:31.030
Let me show you a horse stance first.

29:31.480 --> 29:32.430
I'm not bragging,

29:32.930 --> 29:34.060
but my martial arts

29:34.090 --> 29:34.920
were drilled into me

29:34.920 --> 29:36.440
by my adoptive father.

29:38.310 --> 29:39.480
How is this?

29:39.970 --> 29:41.250
I can teach this martial arts too.

29:41.280 --> 29:42.040
Let me go first.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.300
Leave it to me.

29:45.880 --> 29:46.950
Let me tell you,

29:47.510 --> 29:49.160
although I've taken your silver,

29:49.470 --> 29:51.430
we agreed beforehand

29:51.790 --> 29:52.880
that business is business.

29:53.160 --> 29:55.070
This is a mutual agreement,

29:55.070 --> 29:56.030
a fair trade.

29:56.420 --> 29:57.770
You can't act recklessly.

29:58.510 --> 30:00.510
I'm the town constable, you know.

30:00.920 --> 30:02.000
You're overthinking it.

30:03.160 --> 30:04.350
Business is business.

30:05.160 --> 30:06.480
I know the difference.

30:08.030 --> 30:08.830
Really?

30:09.290 --> 30:10.100
Really.

30:13.250 --> 30:14.380
Are you ready?

30:14.860 --> 30:15.450
Alright.

30:18.910 --> 30:20.260
From the Infinite comes the Supreme Ultimate.

30:20.330 --> 30:21.330
Movement generates Yang energy.

30:31.220 --> 30:32.420
Extreme stillness returns to motion.

30:32.920 --> 30:34.030
Motion and then stillness.

30:34.300 --> 30:35.540
Each is the root of the other.

30:36.550 --> 30:37.720
Dividing into Yin and Yang.

30:38.310 --> 30:39.510
The Two Principles are established.

30:39.530 --> 30:40.620
Stop! Stop! Stop!

30:40.880 --> 30:42.400
I quit! I quit!

30:44.110 --> 30:44.920
No way.

30:45.720 --> 30:47.340
You think my money is so easy to earn?

30:48.620 --> 30:49.540
You said it yourself.

30:49.750 --> 30:50.830
Business is business.

30:50.830 --> 30:52.030
You know the difference.

30:52.270 --> 30:53.680
What are you doing now?

30:53.750 --> 30:54.640
Teaching you, of course.

30:55.790 --> 30:56.960
Paying to teach you

30:56.960 --> 30:57.790
is one thing.

30:57.920 --> 30:59.770
If you make me angry and I beat you up,

31:00.030 --> 31:01.200
that's another thing.

31:01.200 --> 31:02.790
What kind of logic is that?

31:02.920 --> 31:05.270
This is my logic.

31:06.240 --> 31:07.110
The Two Principles generate the Four Images.

31:07.110 --> 31:08.030
The Four Images generate the Eight Trigrams.

31:08.030 --> 31:08.790
The natural order is thus established.

31:08.790 --> 31:10.200
This is honorable title of Heaven's principle.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.510
The ultimate is the utmost extreme.

31:13.510 --> 31:15.070
The pivot is the foundation.

31:20.010 --> 31:23.050
The pivot of heaven is the root.

31:41.380 --> 31:42.180
What's wrong?

31:43.280 --> 31:44.090
I'm not sure.

31:50.400 --> 31:51.350
It feels a bit

31:51.350 --> 31:52.310
different from before.

31:52.660 --> 31:53.750
It's warm here.

31:53.750 --> 31:54.660
Strangely comfortable.

32:00.440 --> 32:01.400
You know,

32:01.510 --> 32:03.430
although you're petty and hit hard,

32:03.790 --> 32:05.180
you do have some skills.

32:05.680 --> 32:06.640
The incantation you just recited,

32:06.670 --> 32:07.400
what was it again?

32:07.480 --> 32:08.270
You said it too fast.

32:08.270 --> 32:09.120
I couldn't hear it clearly.

32:09.140 --> 32:10.180
Could you say it again?

32:11.640 --> 32:13.430
That set of incantations has nothing to do with you.

32:13.900 --> 32:15.140
Nothing to do with me?

32:16.000 --> 32:17.720
Then why were you reciting it just now?

32:20.640 --> 32:22.160
You weren't just reciting it

32:22.160 --> 32:23.790
to stall for time and beat me up, were you?

32:26.310 --> 32:27.240
You really are...

32:29.960 --> 32:31.440
Such a good master, aren't you?

32:32.020 --> 32:33.400
Same time tomorrow.

32:33.400 --> 32:34.680
I've taken the money anyway.

32:34.700 --> 32:35.910
Master, don't be late.

32:48.960 --> 32:51.170
Miss, what kind would you like?

32:51.750 --> 32:52.550
I'd like to choose some

32:52.550 --> 32:53.750
dry and fluffy ones.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.110
No problem.

32:55.160 --> 32:56.110
Tell me,

32:56.160 --> 32:57.720
how many livestock do you have at home?

32:57.750 --> 32:59.550
I'll calculate how much you need to buy.

32:59.640 --> 33:00.680
We don't have any livestock at home.

33:00.680 --> 33:02.000
There's just one sick person.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.720
He's been ill and bedridden

33:03.720 --> 33:04.680
for a long time.

33:04.680 --> 33:06.160
With the weather being so hot lately,

33:06.200 --> 33:07.790
the bedding is always damp.

33:07.790 --> 33:08.270
So I thought

33:08.270 --> 33:09.590
I'd choose some dry straw

33:09.590 --> 33:10.350
to weave a mat for him.

33:10.350 --> 33:11.240
It'll be more breathable.

33:11.550 --> 33:13.350
Miss, you're so thoughtful.

33:13.510 --> 33:15.310
I'll definitely get you the driest ones.

33:15.310 --> 33:16.030
Thank you.

33:45.920 --> 33:46.720
How are you?

33:47.550 --> 33:48.960
Did you suffer internal injuries?

33:50.270 --> 33:51.070
It's hard to say.

33:51.650 --> 33:53.040
What do you mean by that?

33:53.070 --> 33:53.750
If it is, it is.

33:53.750 --> 33:54.960
If it's not, it's not.

33:59.520 --> 34:01.170
I was in the middle of transmitting energy to Lu Chen.

34:01.790 --> 34:03.350
Suddenly, a force appeared in his body

34:03.350 --> 34:04.590
that didn't belong to him

34:04.790 --> 34:06.440
and quickly entered my body.

34:07.030 --> 34:08.840
I think this might be

34:08.840 --> 34:10.280
the reason why Lu Chen broke through the seal prematurely

34:10.280 --> 34:11.710
and lost his memory.

34:13.000 --> 34:14.320
However, now that force

34:14.510 --> 34:15.670
seems to have

34:15.670 --> 34:16.710
settled down inside me.

34:17.230 --> 34:19.000
But it still entered your body.

34:19.440 --> 34:20.230
I'm worried

34:20.230 --> 34:21.630
it might still affect you.

34:22.190 --> 34:23.760
When I saw you practicing earlier,

34:24.030 --> 34:25.230
you didn't look well.

34:27.090 --> 34:29.130
It's fine. I have my own plans.

34:30.190 --> 34:31.110
Don't overthink it.

34:38.550 --> 34:39.440
Does your head hurt?

34:41.070 --> 34:41.880
A little.

34:45.070 --> 34:46.110
Let me massage it for you.

34:54.800 --> 34:56.630
How is it? Do you feel any better?

34:59.320 --> 35:00.000
Then let me

35:00.000 --> 35:01.230
massage your neck.

35:01.400 --> 35:02.710
It'll feel better this way.

35:04.000 --> 35:06.000
You want to share yThe Book of Hundred Skills again, huh?

35:06.590 --> 35:07.630
I did learn

35:07.630 --> 35:09.510
this massage technique from the book.

35:09.840 --> 35:11.440
You really do value her book.

35:12.630 --> 35:14.440
You don't need to be so concerned about it.

35:14.960 --> 35:16.030
Although this technique

35:16.030 --> 35:17.590
was learned from The Book of Hundred Skills,

35:17.590 --> 35:18.190
I have already

35:18.190 --> 35:19.710
tried it on someone else

35:19.780 --> 35:21.010
before using it on you.

35:21.440 --> 35:22.510
Who did you try it on?

35:23.440 --> 35:25.070
The unconscious patient

35:25.070 --> 35:26.150
in the backyard.

35:28.030 --> 35:29.430
He's quite lucky.

35:34.630 --> 35:35.320
Do you think

35:35.320 --> 35:37.030
Pei Jiu's personality will change drastically

35:37.030 --> 35:38.590
after he regains his memory?

35:39.280 --> 35:40.230
I wonder if the landlady

35:40.230 --> 35:41.920
will still like him.

35:42.550 --> 35:43.360
Can they

35:43.360 --> 35:44.800
still be together happily?

35:53.400 --> 35:55.440
Jiu! Jiu!

35:59.000 --> 35:59.800
What's the matter?

36:00.070 --> 36:01.070
What do you mean?

36:01.150 --> 36:02.510
I'm just greeting you.

36:03.190 --> 36:04.000
Don't you recognize me?

36:04.590 --> 36:05.760
By the way, I want to remind you

36:05.780 --> 36:07.670
it's time to pay the debt you owe

36:07.670 --> 36:08.510
at my wife's stall.

36:08.630 --> 36:10.070
You keep buying on credit without paying.

36:10.320 --> 36:11.190
That's not right, is it?

36:11.320 --> 36:13.630
Besides, you've got money now.

36:15.000 --> 36:16.110
I don't even know you.

36:16.110 --> 36:17.180
You're saying I owe you money?

36:17.210 --> 36:18.570
What are you talking about?

36:18.590 --> 36:19.310
Constable Pei,

36:19.940 --> 36:21.230
do you owe?

36:21.420 --> 36:22.710
Of course you do.

36:23.070 --> 36:24.070
I've heard

36:24.090 --> 36:25.150
that you have found

36:25.150 --> 36:26.320
a wealthy master

36:26.620 --> 36:28.140
and you're pretending not to know me already?

36:28.470 --> 36:29.950
If you want to keep up appearances,

36:29.970 --> 36:31.340
at least pay your debts first.

36:32.610 --> 36:33.520
You're crazy.

36:33.840 --> 36:34.350
You...

36:37.880 --> 36:38.510
You...

36:41.900 --> 36:43.710
Your name is right here.

36:44.120 --> 36:45.290
You can't deny it.

36:47.150 --> 36:49.060
[Today, Pei Jiu owes Manager Zhu three taels of silver for meat. Pay it back in half a month. Pei Jiu.]

36:55.000 --> 36:56.040
This way, please, sir.

37:05.070 --> 37:06.320
This way, please, sir.

37:14.960 --> 37:15.760
Sir,

37:16.550 --> 37:17.670
you've eaten every meal here

37:17.670 --> 37:18.960
for so many days in a row.

37:18.980 --> 37:20.140
Aren't you tired of it?

37:20.590 --> 37:22.400
What, are you?

37:24.630 --> 37:25.840
Not yet, actually.

37:25.880 --> 37:26.950
But it will be soon.

37:27.670 --> 37:28.760
Just be patient for a few more days.

37:30.000 --> 37:31.440
If the bait isn't set properly,

37:31.800 --> 37:33.110
how can we catch the fish?

37:34.110 --> 37:34.920
Fish?

37:36.000 --> 37:37.880
We're in the dark here in Yandu.

37:38.210 --> 37:39.600
The enemy is hidden while we're exposed.

37:40.410 --> 37:41.690
Only by shining a bright light

37:42.120 --> 37:43.440
can we lure the fish to take the bait.

37:45.910 --> 37:47.020
You mean

37:47.350 --> 37:48.710
someone is coming to kill us?

37:49.150 --> 37:50.110
It won't come to that.

37:50.360 --> 37:52.000
Are our skills just for show?

37:52.230 --> 37:53.270
The reputation of the immortal race

37:53.430 --> 37:54.920
is enough to deter petty criminals.

37:56.250 --> 37:57.640
If it's not about killing,

37:58.360 --> 37:59.110
then how can we

37:59.110 --> 38:00.710
lure the fish to take the bait?

38:01.360 --> 38:02.480
I think the people involved

38:02.480 --> 38:03.630
will find it hard to remain calm.

38:04.110 --> 38:05.710
Sooner or later, they'll come to investigate.

38:06.410 --> 38:07.440
I understand now.

38:07.880 --> 38:09.360
Whoever approaches us actively,

38:09.460 --> 38:10.540
whoever is most suspicious,

38:10.630 --> 38:12.500
is the fish we're after.

38:19.150 --> 38:20.400
This way, please.

38:31.840 --> 38:32.630
Come, come.

38:33.590 --> 38:35.480
Take a break, have some water. Come on.

38:36.190 --> 38:37.000
Hey, you up there!

38:37.000 --> 38:38.150
Come down and have some water!

38:38.550 --> 38:40.150
No, thanks. I'm busy working.

38:40.920 --> 38:42.480
No rush, this bit of time won't matter.

38:42.480 --> 38:43.510
How can you say there's no rush?

38:43.510 --> 38:44.480
Even if you're not in a hurry,

38:44.480 --> 38:45.570
Constable Pei is!

38:46.000 --> 38:47.030
Have you set a date yet?

38:47.550 --> 38:48.510
Soon, soon.

38:48.710 --> 38:49.670
Let me tell you,

38:49.710 --> 38:51.030
once I've mastered my skills

38:51.320 --> 38:52.630
and finished all these miscellaneous tasks,

38:52.630 --> 38:53.510
we'll get married.

38:54.510 --> 38:55.440
You know what,

38:55.680 --> 38:56.630
my master

38:56.650 --> 38:58.010
really has some skills.

38:58.360 --> 38:59.760
You're a lucky guy!

38:59.920 --> 39:00.880
Everyone in town knows

39:00.910 --> 39:02.310
you've found a wealthy master.

39:03.000 --> 39:03.800
That's right.

39:03.800 --> 39:05.280
Introduce us too.

39:05.380 --> 39:06.860
We'd like to find a master as well.

39:07.110 --> 39:07.920
Yeah.

39:07.920 --> 39:08.710
That's right.

39:09.280 --> 39:11.190
Go away, stop making a scene.

39:11.190 --> 39:12.000
Get back to work.

39:13.630 --> 39:14.440
Miss Ji,

39:14.920 --> 39:16.280
I've always been curious though.

39:17.000 --> 39:18.880
Tell me, what exactly

39:18.880 --> 39:20.190
does my master do?

39:20.480 --> 39:22.400
He must be a big merchant, right?

39:22.550 --> 39:24.630
He used to manage everything,

39:24.760 --> 39:25.550
but now,

39:25.550 --> 39:26.800
he doesn't manage anything anymore.

39:27.410 --> 39:28.330
Alright, alright.

39:28.480 --> 39:29.800
You go back to work, hurry up.

39:31.030 --> 39:31.840
Miss Ji,

39:32.000 --> 39:33.480
don't mind Jiu. Just go about your business.

39:33.510 --> 39:34.320
It's fine.

39:37.800 --> 39:38.800
When we have time later,

39:38.800 --> 39:40.400
we should fix up Uncle Pei's grave.

39:40.480 --> 39:41.480
Now that we're better off,

39:41.480 --> 39:42.440
we shouldn't neglect the old man.

39:42.440 --> 39:43.510
I've been thinking about that.

39:43.510 --> 39:44.320
I went to visit

39:44.320 --> 39:45.590
my adoptive father's grave a couple of days ago.

39:46.320 --> 39:47.110
Also,

39:47.230 --> 39:48.280
the main gate of our courtyard

39:48.280 --> 39:49.400
is always wobbly.

39:49.400 --> 39:50.670
Find time to fix it too.

39:51.800 --> 39:52.630
I'll do whatever you say.

39:52.800 --> 39:53.710
You're the boss.

39:54.830 --> 39:56.230
Don't flatter me.

39:56.440 --> 39:57.150
If you flatter me,

39:57.150 --> 39:57.960
will all the household matters

39:57.960 --> 39:59.000
become my responsibility?

39:59.300 --> 40:00.090
Let me ask you,

40:00.270 --> 40:01.310
if we have a baby,

40:01.330 --> 40:02.120
what are we going to do?

40:04.000 --> 40:04.960
Don't worry about that.

40:04.960 --> 40:05.760
Leave it all to me.

40:05.840 --> 40:07.000
You just focus on giving birth.

40:07.440 --> 40:09.550
What are you talking about?

40:10.450 --> 40:11.800
Don't say that!

40:13.150 --> 40:15.510
Everyone, don't leave later,

40:15.510 --> 40:16.280
okay?

40:16.880 --> 40:17.920
Today, my master

40:17.920 --> 40:19.400
just gave me some money.

40:19.590 --> 40:20.360
It's perfect timing.

40:20.360 --> 40:22.230
I've also paid Mr. Zhu, the meat seller,

40:22.230 --> 40:23.000
settled the bill,

40:23.000 --> 40:23.630
and had him deliver

40:23.630 --> 40:24.630
a bunch of fresh meat.

40:24.630 --> 40:25.320
How about this?

40:25.340 --> 40:26.650
We'll feast

40:26.800 --> 40:28.070
at my place tonight.

40:29.320 --> 40:30.190
You guys go ahead and eat.

40:30.280 --> 40:32.190
We need to head back later

40:32.190 --> 40:33.480
to appease our own wives.

40:36.240 --> 40:37.030
Just these two dishes?

40:38.000 --> 40:39.800
Si took a day off and I can't cook.

40:39.840 --> 40:41.360
Just these two dishes. Take it or leave it.

40:42.920 --> 40:43.710
Yuanzhong,

40:43.880 --> 40:44.630
ever since you refused

40:44.630 --> 40:45.590
to take him as your disciple,

40:45.590 --> 40:46.760
he's been like this.

40:47.760 --> 40:49.150
Eat up. There's nothing else.

40:50.110 --> 40:50.920
Where is

40:51.120 --> 40:51.930
Ji Tanyin?

40:52.000 --> 40:52.840
They all went to Pei Jiu's house

40:52.840 --> 40:53.760
to fix up the place.

40:53.880 --> 40:54.710
I guess

40:54.730 --> 40:56.810
they'll probably eat there after they're done.

40:57.030 --> 40:58.630
I just saw someone delivering meat there.

40:59.030 --> 41:00.070
I bet tonight

41:00.150 --> 41:01.400
they're going to have a good meal.

41:04.900 --> 41:07.490
My disciple and my handmaiden

41:07.800 --> 41:08.920
are using my money

41:09.630 --> 41:11.280
to have a good time out there, huh?

41:13.230 --> 41:14.030
Yuanzhong,

41:14.880 --> 41:15.670
eat quickly.

41:15.920 --> 41:17.360
The food will taste worse if it gets cold.

41:24.370 --> 41:25.320
Aren't you eating?

41:25.350 --> 41:26.910
I'm not hungry. You go ahead and eat.

41:28.620 --> 41:29.620
Zi Fei, you're not eating either?

41:30.010 --> 41:31.370
No, you eat first.

41:39.120 --> 41:39.930
Yuanzhong,

41:41.230 --> 41:41.960
when do you think

41:41.960 --> 41:43.230
Lu Chen will wake up?

41:44.840 --> 41:45.380
Soon.

41:45.570 --> 41:46.670
I think he seems

41:46.670 --> 41:48.050
quite happy as Pei Jiu.

41:48.630 --> 41:50.400
I've never seen him this happy before.

41:50.670 --> 41:51.480
Yeah,

41:52.150 --> 41:52.960
I wonder

41:53.480 --> 41:54.710
if he'll still be

41:55.030 --> 41:56.280
this happy after he wakes up.

42:00.670 --> 42:02.100
The roast chicken is here!

42:02.840 --> 42:04.110
Stop fussing around and sit down.

42:04.190 --> 42:05.000
Okay.

42:05.630 --> 42:06.760
So many dishes!

42:06.960 --> 42:07.710
Can the three of us

42:07.710 --> 42:08.920
finish it all?

42:09.320 --> 42:10.190
Pei Jiu, Pei Jiu!

42:10.480 --> 42:11.400
Are you home?

42:12.760 --> 42:13.550
Wait for me.

42:15.770 --> 42:17.120
I knew you'd come.

42:17.800 --> 42:18.480
Come in quickly.

42:18.480 --> 42:19.110
Alright.

42:19.110 --> 42:19.880
Come on, let me tell you.

42:19.880 --> 42:20.800
You're in for a treat today,

42:20.800 --> 42:21.550
you know?

42:21.960 --> 42:22.760
Here.

42:24.480 --> 42:25.480
This wine is really good.

42:25.560 --> 42:26.730
There's wine and meat here.

42:26.760 --> 42:27.960
What's the occasion today?

42:28.070 --> 42:29.760
It's the day for house renovation, of course.

42:29.760 --> 42:30.510
No.

42:32.030 --> 42:34.840
Today is our engagement.

42:36.480 --> 42:37.730
The date has been set?

42:37.920 --> 42:38.710
Yes.

42:39.030 --> 42:39.630
Today, I

42:39.630 --> 42:40.960
went to Blind Liu for a fortune-telling.

42:41.150 --> 42:43.150
The 9th of next month is an auspicious day.

42:43.320 --> 42:45.480
So, I plan to take Yunniang home

42:45.960 --> 42:47.190
as my bride that day.

42:47.770 --> 42:48.960
That's wonderful!

42:48.990 --> 42:50.800
So, it's just in a few days, isn't it?
